ight":45},{"text":"전달","x":1040,"y":498,"width":82,"height":43}]},{"text":"인터넷의 네트워크 계#-(IP 서비스)은 비신뢰적이라고 앞에서 배웠다. 인터넷 프로토","words":[{"text":"인터넷의","x":566,"y":597,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크","x":713,"y":596,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"계#-(IP","x":862,"y":596,"width":111,"height":38},{"text":"서비스)은","x":989,"y":597,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"비신뢰적이라고","x":1151,"y":596,"width":235,"height":37},{"text":"앞에서","x":1403,"y":596,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"배웠다.","x":1521,"y":596,"width":109,"height":37},{"text":"인터넷","x":1651,"y":596,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"프로토","x":1765,"y":598,"width":91,"height":34}]},{"text":"콜은 데이터그램 전달을 보장하지 않고, 데이터그램이 순서대로 전달된다는 것을 보장","words":[{"text":"콜은","x":562,"y":657,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"데이터그램","x":642,"y":656,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"전달을","x":822,"y":655,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"보장하지","x":932,"y":656,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"않고,","x":1079,"y":656,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"데이터그램이","x":1168,"y":656,"width":199,"height":37},{"text":"순서대로","x":1384,"y":656,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"전달된다는","x":1536,"y":656,"width":171,"height":36},{"text":"것을","x":1722,"y":654,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"보장","x":1797,"y":658,"width":60,"height":38}]},{"text":"하지 않는다. 또한, 데이터그램에 포함된 데이터의 무결성(integrfly)을 보장하지 않는","words":[{"text":"하지","x":562,"y":716,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"않는다.","x":643,"y":715,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"또한,","x":766,"y":715,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"데이터그램에","x":857,"y":715,"width":197,"height":37},{"text":"포함된","x":1070,"y":715,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"데이터의","x":1187,"y":715,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"무결성(integrfly)을","x":1336,"y":715,"width":297,"height":41},{"text":"보장하지","x":1647,"y":714,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"않는","x":1797,"y":715,"width":59,"height":40}]},{"text":"다. IP 서비스에서 데이터 그램은 라우터의 버퍼를 오버플로 상태로 만들 수도 있으며,","words":[{"text":"다.","x":562,"y":777,"width":39,"height":37},{"text":"IP","x":616,"y":