":"트랜","x":1795,"y":898,"width":60,"height":38}]},{"text":"스포트 계층의 세그먼트가 IP 데이터그램에 의해서 네트워크상에서 운반되므로, 이러","words":[{"text":"스포트","x":558,"y":961,"width":100,"height":29},{"text":"계층의","x":673,"y":956,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"세그먼트가","x":785,"y":956,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"IP","x":965,"y":961,"width":34,"height":28},{"text":"데이터그램에","x":1015,"y":955,"width":198,"height":38},{"text":"의해서","x":1231,"y":955,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크상에서","x":1349,"y":956,"width":234,"height":38},{"text":"운반되므로,","x":1601,"y":955,"width":179,"height":37},{"text":"이러","x":1797,"y":955,"width":56,"height":42}]},{"text":"한 문제들은 트랜스포트 계층의 세그먼트에게 많은 영향을 준다.","words":[{"text":"한","x":557,"y":1020,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"문제들은","x":602,"y":1018,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":747,"y":1017,"width":166,"height":37},{"text":"계층의","x":927,"y":1017,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"세그먼트에게","x":1038,"y":1016,"width":200,"height":38},{"text":"많은","x":1253,"y":1016,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"영향을","x":1336,"y":1017,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"준다.","x":1449,"y":1018,"width":77,"height":37}]},{"text":"TCP는 IP의 비신뢰적인 “최선형(best-effoft)” 서비스에서 신뢰적인 데이터 전달","words":[{"text":"TCP는","x":621,"y":1081,"width":104,"height":34},{"text":"IP의","x":739,"y":1078,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"비신뢰적인","x":824,"y":1077,"width":163,"height":39},{"text":"“최선형(best-effoft)”","x":1005,"y":1077,"width":315,"height":39},{"text":"서비스에서","x":1338,"y":1078,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"신뢰적인","x":1526,"y":1077,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"데이터","x":1680,"y":1076,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"전달","x":1797,"y":1077,"width":60,"height":41}]},{"text":"서비스(reliable data transfer service)를 제공한다. TCP의 신뢰적인 데이터 전달 서","words":[{"text":"서비스(reliable","x":556,"y":1141,"width":234,"height":38},{"text":"data","x":801,"y":1144,"width":71,"height":29},{"text":"transfer","x":884,"y":1143,"width":131,"height":29},{"text":"service)를","x":1027,"y":1139,"width":160,"height":38},{"text":"제공한다.","x":1201,"y":1137,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"TCP의","x":1361,"y":1139,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"신뢰적인","x":1483,"y":1139,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"데이터","x":1635,"y":1138,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"전달","x":1752,"y":1137,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"서","x":1827,"y":1142,"width":25,"height":38}]},{"text":"비스는 프로세스가 자신의 수신 버퍼로부터 읽은 데이터 스트림이 손상되지 않았으며","words":[{"text":"비스는","x":557,"y":1203,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스가","x":669,"y":1201,"width":168,"height":39},{"text":"자신의","x":850,"y":1200,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"수신","x":963,"y":1200,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"버퍼로부터","x":1045,"y":1199,"width":163,"height":39},{"text":"읽은","x":1229,"y":1199,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"데이터","x":1310,"y":1200,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"스트림이","x":1426,"y":1201,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"손상되지","x":1578,"y":1200,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"않았으며","x":1731,"y":1199,"width":121,"height":42}]},{"text":"손실이나 중복이 없다는 것과 순서가 유지된다는 것을 보장한다. 다시 말해서, 바이트","words":[{"text":"손실이나","x":555,"y":1264,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"중복이","x":702,"y":1264,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"없다는","x":820,"y":1263,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"것과","x":932,"y":1262,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"순서가","x":1011,"y":1262,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"유지된다는","x":1125,"y":1261,"width":171,"height":39},{"text":"것을","x":1312,"y":1262,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"보장한다.","x":1393,"y":1262,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"다시","x":1555,"y":1262,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"말해서,","x":1638,"y":1261,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"바이트","x":1764,"y":1261,"width":92,"height":38}]},{"text":"스트림은 송신자가 전송한 것과 같은 바이트 스트림이다. TCP의 신뢰성 있는 데이터","words":[{"text":"스트림은","x":556,"y":1325,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"송신자가","x":703,"y":1325,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"전송한","x":853,"y":1324,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"것과","x":968,"y":1324,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"같은","x":1049,"y":1324,"width":66,"height